AcceptedSnapshotWithSequence ..> ExpectedTracingPolicyBase : expectedBase()
AcceptedPolicyProjection *--> AgentReadinessView
AcceptedPolicyProjection *--> AcceptedPolicyLeaves
CompleteTracingPolicyReader ..> AcceptedSnapshotWithSequence : returns
AcceptedTracingPolicyReader ..> AcceptedPolicyProjection : returns

